# What a Mac with Homebrew needs to build (README.md, "Build et tests").
# No CI job reads this file: the only CI build is the Linux one.
# Homebrew's `ffmpeg` formula has no `drawtext` filter (seen on
# 1 October 2026, FFmpeg 9.0.1): since 9 October 2026 the engine
# draws captions itself and no longer needs it. See README.md, "Build et
# tests".
brew "ffmpeg"
brew "pkg-config"
brew "cmake"
brew "ccache"
